+// Copyright 2026 SugiyamaLabs.
+// - One queue for every ask, in the order they came; only the oldest of each tab and kind is on
+//   the host at a time, and at most kMaxOpenUiAsks wait in all.
+// - What the person typed (a password, a prompt's text) only passes through `done`: never in an
